   "text": "The University of Europe for Applied Sciences - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nThe University of Europe for Applied Sciences\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUniversity of Applied Sciences Europe (UE) educates the designers and decision-makers of tomorrow in the fields of Business, Sports, Media & Event and Art & Design. All programs taught in English. As a state-accredited university in Germany UE promote especially independent entrepreneurial-creative thinking and acting. UE have three campuses in Berlin, Hamburg, or Iserlohn where international exchange, creativity, and digital thinking are united.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n04/05/2026 09:27\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:42\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €12,541.00\nMin: €10,331.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n35%\n630 of 1,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nGUS (Global University Systems)\nFounded Year\n2017\nCampus(es)\nIserlohn, Berlin, Hamburg, Potsdam\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n21/06/2023\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@UEGermany\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
